    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The five-bedroom houses are the signature family residences at Mount Auburn Park, offering approximately 235 sq.m / 2,530 sq.ft of beautifully considered accommodation across three levels.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor provides an impressive combination of everyday and recreational space, including a dedicated cinema room, 2 no bedrooms, boot room and guest WC.\r\n\r\nThe principal living level on this first floor is designed for entertaining and family life, with a generous living and dining space, beautifully appointed kitchen and separate utility. Bedroom 3 and the family bathroom are also positioned on this level. A defining feature of this level is its spectacular outlook across Dublin Bay, with expansive views creating an ever-changing backdrop to everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe top floor creates an impressive principal suite enjoying its own en-suite, walk-in wardrobe and access to a terrace. Bedroom 2 is also en-suite, while terraces to either end of this house introduce valuable outdoor space at this elevated level.\r\n\r\nThe result is an exceptionally spacious contemporary home that combines family practicality with the quality, privacy and setting that define Mount Auburn Park."
      },
      {
